  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"about.html\">Company</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Partners</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Company</p>\n        <h1 class=\"display\">The network behind the distribution.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">PressCosmos distributes through contracted editorial and feed partners. We publish the categories we contract with rather than a logo wall we cannot substantiate.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"contact.html\">Become a partner</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"distribution.html\">Distribution details</a></div>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  PressCosmos contracts distribution through newswire partners, regional and metro press desks, industry trade publications, broadcaster and podcast networks, news aggregators, financial data feeds and AI retrieval systems. Partner names are disclosed to customers in the delivery log for each release.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Network</p>\n      <h2>Partner categories</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-2\">\n    \n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3.5 9h17M3.5 15h17\"/><path d=\"M12 3c2.5 2.6 2.5 15.4 0 18M12 3c-2.5 2.6-2.5 15.4 0 18\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Newswire and feed partners</h3>\n  <p>Contracted lanes carrying releases to national and international newswire feeds and data terminals.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3.5 9h17M3.5 15h17\"/><path d=\"M12 3c2.5 2.6 2.5 15.4 0 18M12 3c-2.5 2.6-2.5 15.4 0 18\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Regional and metro press</h3>\n  <p>Local dailies, business journals and city desks reached through regional routing.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3.5 9h17M3.5 15h17\"/><path d=\"M12 3c2.5 2.6 2.5 15.4 0 18M12 3c-2.5 2.6-2.5 15.4 0 18\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Industry trade publications</h3>\n  <p>Sector-specific titles across twelve verticals, each with its own editorial gate.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3.5 9h17M3.5 15h17\"/><path d=\"M12 3c2.5 2.6 2.5 15.4 0 18M12 3c-2.5 2.6-2.5 15.4 0 18\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Broadcast and podcast networks</h3>\n  <p>Audio and video desks that pick up newsworthy announcements for segments.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3.5 9h17M3.5 15h17\"/><path d=\"M12 3c2.5 2.6 2.5 15.4 0 18M12 3c-2.5 2.6-2.5 15.4 0 18\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Aggregators and news apps</h3>\n  <p>Distribution platforms and news applications that surface releases to consumer audiences.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3.5 9h17M3.5 15h17\"/><path d=\"M12 3c2.5 2.6 2.5 15.4 0 18M12 3c-2.5 2.6-2.5 15.4 0 18\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>AI and retrieval systems</h3>\n  <p>Machine-readable feeds and open crawler access enabling citation inside AI answers.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"callout mt-4\" data-reveal>\n    <strong>Why we do not list partner logos</strong>\n    Using a media company's trademark to imply a commercial relationship that is not documented is a legal risk and a credibility risk. Every customer receives the actual delivery list for their own release, which is more useful than a logo wall anyway.\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Channel programme</p>\n      <h2>Partner with PressCosmos</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\">\n    \n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z\"/><path d=\"m3.5 12.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/><path d=\"m3.5 16.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>PR agencies</h3>\n  <p>White-label distribution, multi-client workspaces and reporting under your own brand. Volume pricing from ten releases a month.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"agencies.html\">Learn more <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z\"/><path d=\"m3.5 12.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/><path d=\"m3.5 16.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Media monitoring vendors</h3>\n  <p>Add distribution to your monitoring product through our API, with revenue share on distributed releases.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Learn more <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z\"/><path d=\"m3.5 12.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/><path d=\"m3.5 16.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>PR software platforms</h3>\n  <p>Embed distribution as a feature through the PressCosmos API, with embeddable reporting components.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Learn more <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z\"/><path d=\"m3.5 12.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/><path d=\"m3.5 16.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Newswire and feed operators</h3>\n  <p>Licence our AI visibility layer and answer-engine formatting for your existing distribution network.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Learn more <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z\"/><path d=\"m3.5 12.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/><path d=\"m3.5 16.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Resellers and consultants</h3>\n  <p>Referral and reseller terms for consultants who advise comms teams but do not distribute themselves.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Learn more <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z\"/><path d=\"m3.5 12.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/><path d=\"m3.5 16.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Academic and non-profit</h3>\n  <p>Reduced or free distribution for qualifying public-interest research and student journalism projects.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Learn more <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Interested in a channel agreement?</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">Tell us what you already do well and where distribution fits. Most partnership conversations start with one joint customer.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"contact.html\">Contact partnerships</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"pricing.html\">See pricing</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">No subscription required · Cancel anytime · Human editorial review on every release</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "priority": 0.6
}
